WEBVTT

1
00:01:21.733 --> 00:01:25.824
&lt;i&gt;船长的日志,开始58053.9.&lt;/i&gt;

2
00:01:25.867 --> 00:01:28.479
&lt;i&gt;The&lt;/i&gt; Cerritos &lt;i &gt;is escorting a Doopler 发行人&lt;/i &gt;

